      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Test data · editor run\nPin this on `When Executed by Another Workflow` (open the node, use the output panel's edit / mock-data control, paste the JSON, save), then click *Execute workflow*.\nWrites nothing (`run_id: 0` belongs to no run).\n\n```json\n[{\"run_id\": 0, \"profile_id\": 1}]\n```",
